{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All features of the retail version are available for a limited time until the end of the Steam Next festival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brand-new party game that mixes romance and deception!</strong> <br>Confess your love and take down your opponents! <br>Enjoy thrilling mind games in this fully command-based online PvP experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to <strong>successfully confess your feelings to other players</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your confession <strong>succeeds</strong>, the player you confessed to is <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it <strong>fails</strong>, you\u2019re the one who gets <strong>eliminated</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use confessions to eliminate all players on the opposing team and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through alternating <strong>Day</strong> and <strong>Night Turns</strong>. <br>Each turn, players choose <strong>one command</strong> from a set of actions and execute it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Day Turns</strong>, you can raise another player's affection toward you, increasing your chance of a successful confession.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>Night Turns</strong>, you can confess and try to eliminate someone from the game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>online PvP game for 2 to 8 players</strong> only. <br>You cannot play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Match</strong>: Get matched with random players who are online at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Match</strong>: Play only with players who enter the same password as you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fresh New Way to Connect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The theme is romance!</strong>\u00a0 <br>Enjoy conversations and playful teasing you wouldn\u2019t normally have! <br>You might even discover your friends\u2019 secret views on love\u2026!?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041570?t=1758341658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041570?t=1758341658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041570/c275136fece1705b32cf3014b9372dee8e051077/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758341658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041570/c275136fece1705b32cf3014b9372dee8e051077/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758341658","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All features of the retail version are available for a limited time until the end of the Steam Next festival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brand-new party game that mixes romance and deception!</strong> <br>Confess your love and take down your opponents! <br>Enjoy thrilling mind game